Good -- both files contain identical 102 heroes, making them a perfect pair for comparison. I now have a complete understanding of the codebase. Here is the detailed implementation plan.

---

## Comprehensive Implementation Plan

### 1. File Renames (manual step)

Rename the two SG data files to a consistent format:

```
曙光英雄/曙光英雄_2026,7-13.json  -->  曙光英雄/曙光英雄_2026-07-13.json
曙光英雄/曙光英雄_2026-7-20.json  -->  曙光英雄/曙光英雄_2026-07-20.json
```

The standard is `{gameName}_{YYYY-MM-DD}.json`. This makes dates lexicographically sortable and parseable via `Date.parse()` or simple string comparison.

---

